# What the ST prints reaches the RP intact: our ESC/P pages (TEXT.PRN and
# GRAPH.PRN, sent byte by byte through BIOS Bconout(0) by PRFILES from the
# floppy's AUTO folder) go through the hook, as 1 KB blocks and a last one
# sent when printing pauses, to the RP, which writes them as one job,
# PRINTER/00000001.PRN on its card, once its idle timeout has passed: equal
# to the two files byte for byte.
@disk-a tools/dev/builds/disks/escp.st
text "Atari +: (ST|STE|Mega STE), TOS" 1500
key f
key 0x1c
wait 100
key 0x01
wait 900
key 0x39
cardfile PRINTER/*.PRN 2938 3000
cardsame PRINTER/00000001.PRN tools/dev/builds/disks/escp-expected.prn
hookstate
